## Section

```elixir
sql_template = """
SELECT DATE(datetime) as date, SUM(price) AS price_sum
    FROM orders
    WHERE datetime >= {{start_datetime}} AND datetime < {{end_datetime}}
    GROUP BY date
    ORDER BY date
"""

{:ok, data} =
  Carrier.Data.QueryData.query(%{
    org_id: 1,
    conn_info_id: 1,
    sql_template: sql_template,
    datetime: DateTime.utc_now(),
    timezone: "Asia/Seoul",
    period: 28,
    window_size: 7,
    limit: 5
  })
```

```elixir
Kino.DataTable.new(data)
```
